# and it should contain paired lines with user id vs. name of file with API key.
# It is e.g.:
# ef89034aaf66e37d4eea7438913d934b
# user_001.key
#
# The directory where the files with API keys are to be located is specified
# in configuration: "keys"/"regular_users".
#
